 ('affbc0b4-52e4-5a17-8da3-d70fa14231f3', '2026-27', array['common_app']::text[], true, 1, true, 75, true, 'Common App personal statement plus two Babson supplemental essays; one counselor and one teacher recommendation. The deadlines page lists CSS Profile aid deadlines (Nov 15 for ED I/EA, Feb 1 for ED II/RD); international applicants seeking need-based aid (Global Scholars) must submit the CSS Profile. Deadline pages do not print the entry year; dates are treated as the fall 2027 cycle. Interview policy not confirmed on pages checked.', '53869956-2e35-59ce-acea-532d81f16cd6');
