 ('affbc0b4-52e4-5a17-8da3-d70fa14231f3', 'required_nonnative', 'A TOEFL, Duolingo or IELTS score is required only for international students whose native language is not English; scores must be official at the time of application. Babson does not publish minimum scores on the pages checked. Cambridge exams are also accepted.', '10ac46c7-64a7-54a4-be94-e4f94cf5b5b8');
