 ('a4d5a870-eb91-5f1d-acd3-9f1963d4ade7', '2025-2026', 61188, 22832, 3201, 2810, 1744, 49217, 14324, 8932, 6586, 19524, 753, 43, 9, 3.88, 100, '{"4.0": 63.92, "3.75-3.99": 17.61, "3.50-3.74": 11.56, "3.25-3.49": 4.25, "3.00-3.24": 2.16, "2.50-2.99": 0.5}'::jsonb, 'C1 totals are the residency-table totals (male+female+unknown sum is 61,197 / 22,835 admits). Out-of-state figures exclude international. Early action only (no ED): 34,283 EA applications, 14,315 admitted (CDS C22). GPA bands are the six filled rows of C11 ''all enrolled students'' read in order from 4.0 downward; they sum to 100 and reproduce the reported 3.88 average. Waitlist accepted count is blank in the CDS.', 'b27bf1e0-90ce-595b-b0d2-218db3c7d73b');
