 ('8b8b98b6-5774-572f-9165-4f70cbccd04a', '2023-2024', 68056, 21244, 1274, 2690, 88414, 'need_aware_limited', true, true, 'College Scorecard (IPEDS 2023-24): tuition includes required fees; on-campus cost of attendance.; Emory offers need-based aid to ''a select group'' of international students each year. International students must apply for aid during the admission process and apply Regular Decision to be considered for need-based aid; CSS Profile required. Limited merit scholarships are available to international students through the Emory University Scholar programs (apply before December). Whether Emory meets full need for international students is not stated on this page.', 'a4d76ae1-378d-56eb-b739-c91efa3e0a81');
