 ('9c86dfbf-11f2-574a-82ad-4aca309eb19d', '2026-27', array['common_app','coalition']::text[], 0, true, 'not_offered', 80, 'One letter of recommendation required, from a counselor or an academic teacher. Optional writing supplement. Evaluative interviews are not required or offered; an optional InitialView video interview does not replace the English requirement. BFA applicants (except Interior Architecture) need a portfolio.', 'e117a730-b12b-58ae-9ad5-fd8d7258a9ae');
