 ('d47e42b4-c1ae-59a6-8e16-044e4429a3bd', '2023-2024', 17256, 44640, 12928, 1420, 5240, 33710, 'merit_only', true, 'College Scorecard (IPEDS 2023-24): tuition includes required fees; on-campus cost of attendance.; International students are not eligible for aid through FAFSA. All admitted international students are automatically considered for the MSU Non-resident Scholarship ($3,000 to $18,000 a year, award levels by academic performance; decisions by mid-February); applying by Nov 1 gives maximum consideration.', 'ef1846e3-e5fd-5c7b-8628-c3fa32984387');
