 ('35228703-5f8c-5c73-8e57-d772f27d443f', '2023-2024', 70640, 20116, 1000, 1000, 88850, 'need_aware_full_need', true, true, 'College Scorecard (IPEDS 2023-24): tuition includes required fees; on-campus cost of attendance.; Need-aware in admission of international students; international students seeking aid must apply for it when they apply for admission. Middlebury meets 100% of demonstrated need for admitted students. CSS Profile (code 3526) required; the ISFAA and paper CSS Profile are not accepted. The pages checked describe need-based aid only; merit awards not confirmed.', '644e6811-2b26-5506-b29d-9141d0da0a0f');
