 ('72d50d3c-d19a-5f32-ab10-e884f6a72409', '2023-2024', 61804, 16750, 1100, 1790, 77257, 'merit_only', false, false, true, 'College Scorecard (IPEDS 2023-24): tuition includes required fees; on-campus cost of attendance.; International first-year applicants are considered for merit scholarships at admission (SAT/ACT encouraged); full-tuition scholarships are not available. RIT need-based grants are awarded from FAFSA results (CSS Profile not used), and the need-based page describes extra need-based aid only for Canadian students. I-20 requires documented support of at least $78,000 USD.', '2ef59eee-88d9-542f-946c-2d8a2f79bbf6');
