 ('8ea56d2f-0a4b-5ce5-a0cd-79ba8b776875', '2023-2024', 66032, 18560, 1380, 1780, 85291, 'merit_only', false, false, true, 'College Scorecard (IPEDS 2023-24): tuition includes required fees; on-campus cost of attendance.; "Limited merit scholarship opportunities" for undergraduate international students, up to $20,000 per year; all non-U.S. citizens/permanent residents must be prepared to pay the full cost of attendance. After enrolling, F-1/J-1 students must submit the International Student Financial Statement showing about one year of liquid funds (approx. $80,000 USD).', '4e479ab5-89d5-50e6-a88f-e089608b4d3e');
