 ('443a83c6-2196-5af3-8581-4f0e250fec98', 'required_nonnative', 'Exceptions: native English speakers, applicants who attended their entire secondary school career at a school taught in English, SAT EBRW 630+, or ACT 27+ on both Reading and English. College English courses do not satisfy the requirement. TOEFL MyBest, TOEFL ITP Plus and TOEFL iBT At Home are not accepted.', '2df8a885-9858-5671-b552-acb03784d17f');
