 ('6310294e-4946-5b59-9434-db0e60773dcc', '2023-2024', 13154, 39974, 12522, 946, 5864, 32796, 'none', false, false, 'College Scorecard (IPEDS 2023-24): tuition includes required fees; on-campus cost of attendance.; F-1 students are not eligible for need-based state aid (ITPEG, up to $4,000) in their first academic year; they may apply in later years through the TASFA. International students enrolled at College Station may be considered for university scholarships via the University Scholarship Application. No aid for entering international first-years was found.', '59367752-61cd-539a-aa3f-7e7e63e7709f');
