 ('0372d659-4914-5a6d-bf27-942e155458e9', '2023-2024', 22431, 61457, 15300, 1520, 3530, 41803, 'none', false, false, 'College Scorecard (IPEDS 2023-24): tuition includes required fees; on-campus cost of attendance.; UVA states it has no funds for scholarships or loans for international students who are foreign nationals, and does not recommend applying without means to pay; admitted students must submit a Financial Guarantee. Exception: graduates of United World College schools qualify for need-based scholarship support (Davis Foundation Scholarship).', '1e520b92-19d6-5017-9ae1-0ba5bbfcb5ab');
